   "h": "Diaz Accepts Emiliano Vargas Callout For Boxing Fight Next",
   "sum": "JoJo Diaz says yes to a boxing callout and wants Emiliano Vargas right after his December BKB fight.",
   "tags": [
    "JoJo Diaz",
    "Emiliano Vargas"
   ],
   "q": "Emiliano, let's make it happen, man. I think that uh that's the fight that I want next after this my next BKB fight.",
   "who": "JoJo Diaz",
   "ctx": "Interview with FightHype's Frankie Martinez",
   "ev": "DIAZ VS VARGAS",
   "body": [
    "Asked about a boxing callout, JoJo Diaz said he is ready to make a fight with Emiliano Vargas. He wants it to be his next fight after his December BKB date.",
    "Diaz said he has to take care of that December fight first, and then he wants Vargas. He called Vargas a dangerous, fan-friendly fighter who knocks people out and gives fans what they want to see.",
    "Diaz said he is in his prime and wants to give fans a good night of boxing. He added, “I don't shy away from any smoke,” and said everyone would be excited if the fight happens.",
    "Why it matters: No date or venue is set, but Diaz has now publicly said yes to Vargas. Two fan-friendly punchers could make this a fight fans want."
   ],
