   "c": "boxing",
   "mood": "Callout",
   "h": "Sanchez Says Haney Thinks He's Bigger Than Boxing Over VADA",
   "sum": "Trainer Abel Sanchez wants mandatory testing for title fights and says Haney is putting himself above the sport by staying out of VADA.",
   "tags": [
    "Abel Sanchez",
    "Devin Haney",
    "Liam Paro"
   ],
   "q": "I think that he thinks he's more than what he is.",
   "who": "Abel Sanchez, trainer",
   "ctx": "Interview with FightHype's Frankie Martinez",
   "ev": "HANEY VS PARO",
   "body": [
    "Asked about Devin Haney not being enrolled in VADA testing before his fight with Liam Paro, Sanchez said testing should be mandatory for anyone fighting for a title. His rule is simple: no testing, no fight. He said promoters have to go along with it.",
    "Sanchez said the sport is bigger than Haney and that promoters and organizations should put their foot down. He added: “there's a lot of dirty fighters in this business and we all know it.”",
    "The interviewer asked about Haney possibly enrolling in VADA after the fight. Sanchez said the timing makes no difference, because anything in a fighter's system would still be there a week later. He called the idea a pretense to act like he's in charge. He also pointed to Ryan Garcia's positive test as proof that dirty fighters exist.",
    "Why it matters: Fans were already pushing back on Haney's testing stance, according to the interviewer, and a well-known trainer is now adding to the pressure with the fight about three weeks away."
   ],
   "id": "sanchez-says-haney-thinks-he-s-bigger-than-boxing-over-vada-zv_rgc",
