  {
   "fid": "2026-11-27-andy-cruz-artur-subkhankulov",
   "c": "boxing",
   "mood": "Result",
   "h": "Cruz Beats Subkhankulov To Win Vacant IBF Lightweight Title",
   "sum": "Andy Cruz takes the vacant IBF lightweight belt on the scorecards. Hosts liked the win but wanted a finish and rank him behind the division's top two.",
   "tags": [
    "Andy Cruz",
    "Artur Subkhankulov"
   ],
   "q": "I think he's the third or fourth best champion in the lightweight division.",
   "who": "Men at Work hosts",
   "ctx": "Live show commentary on the fight, Men at Work episode 16",
   "ev": "CRUZ VS SUBKHANKULOV",
   "body": [
    "Andy Cruz is the new IBF lightweight champion. The hosts watched the fight live, and after the scorecards were read they called it a deserved win over Artur Subkhankulov for the vacant belt.",
    "Cruz leaned on his straight right hand and had Subkhankulov's right eye closing up late. The hosts said he had a knockdown in the second round. They also said he was dropped at the end of the eighth, then steadied himself and closed strongly.",
    "The hosts still wanted more. They said Cruz threw three punches at most in a sequence and did not follow up after the knockdown. They ranked him behind Abdullah Mason and William Zepeda, with Kid Austin also ahead of him in some of their picks.",
    "Why it matters: Cruz now holds a world title, and the hosts said he is a free agent, which gives him a platform for a bigger fight at 135 pounds. They also said he has to prove he can finish opponents."
   ],
   "id": "cruz-beats-subkhankulov-to-win-vacant-ibf-lightweight-title-mlhgup",
